{"4877970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exploding Delivery Service", "steam_appid": 4877970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos Needs Teamwork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/c59edb6186cfe5d2324d1884ac07df1a.poster.avif?t=1787275223\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/c59edb6186cfe5d2324d1884ac07df1a.webm?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/c59edb6186cfe5d2324d1884ac07df1a.mp4?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>One player drives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone else tries to keep the truck and the driver from becoming tomorrow's headline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Exploding Delivery Service</strong>, you and your friends work for a delivery company with questionable hiring standards, transporting unstable packages across increasingly dangerous routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The driver insists they &quot;see just fine.&quot; Nobody else agrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While they're dodging traffic, potholes, and disasters with almost no visibility, the rest of the crew must guide the driver, secure the cargo, and stop everything from flying across the truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication isn't optional.<br>It's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Based Cargo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/095f3e7be5d0b6ab5f646c25a1f0cc00.poster.avif?t=1787275223\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/095f3e7be5d0b6ab5f646c25a1f0cc00.webm?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/095f3e7be5d0b6ab5f646c25a1f0cc00.mp4?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every package is fully simulated using physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp turns, sudden braking, crashes, rough roads, and bad driving send cargo sliding, tipping, and colliding around the truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some packages are fragile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others are highly unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the wrong package takes too much damage... expect fireworks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work Together<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/f71a5e97d3bc4f892a7ffd3caa2196d1.poster.avif?t=1787275223\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/f71a5e97d3bc4f892a7ffd3caa2196d1.webm?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/f71a5e97d3bc4f892a7ffd3caa2196d1.mp4?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on coordination.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the driver through dangerous roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch sliding packages before they crash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack and secure cargo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle random disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver before time runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep damage to a minimum for maximum payout</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No single player can do everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn More. Upgrade More.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/785335c5c072870fa7ffcbeadd1e6d00.poster.avif?t=1787275223\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/785335c5c072870fa7ffcbeadd1e6d00.webm?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/785335c5c072870fa7ffcbeadd1e6d00.mp4?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete deliveries to earn <strong>Stamps</strong>, the company's official currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New worker cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New customization options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the most stylish delivery crew that's ever accidentally blown up a truck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Shift Is Different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two deliveries play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random road events, unpredictable hazards, unstable cargo, and increasingly ridiculous jobs keep every shift fresh and chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One perfect delivery can be followed immediately by complete disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based cargo simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team communication focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driver with heavily obstructed visibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random disasters and unpredictable events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive and fragile packages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy using <strong>Stamps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly stylized visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly challenging deliveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your crew finish the shift...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or will everything explode?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos Needs Teamwork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/c59edb6186cfe5d2324d1884ac07df1a.poster.avif?t=1787275223\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/c59edb6186cfe5d2324d1884ac07df1a.webm?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/c59edb6186cfe5d2324d1884ac07df1a.mp4?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>One player drives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone else tries to keep the truck and the driver from becoming tomorrow's headline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Exploding Delivery Service</strong>, you and your friends work for a delivery company with questionable hiring standards, transporting unstable packages across increasingly dangerous routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The driver insists they &quot;see just fine.&quot; Nobody else agrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While they're dodging traffic, potholes, and disasters with almost no visibility, the rest of the crew must guide the driver, secure the cargo, and stop everything from flying across the truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication isn't optional.<br>It's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Based Cargo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/095f3e7be5d0b6ab5f646c25a1f0cc00.poster.avif?t=1787275223\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/095f3e7be5d0b6ab5f646c25a1f0cc00.webm?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/095f3e7be5d0b6ab5f646c25a1f0cc00.mp4?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every package is fully simulated using physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp turns, sudden braking, crashes, rough roads, and bad driving send cargo sliding, tipping, and colliding around the truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some packages are fragile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others are highly unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the wrong package takes too much damage... expect fireworks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work Together<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/f71a5e97d3bc4f892a7ffd3caa2196d1.poster.avif?t=1787275223\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/f71a5e97d3bc4f892a7ffd3caa2196d1.webm?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/f71a5e97d3bc4f892a7ffd3caa2196d1.mp4?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on coordination.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the driver through dangerous roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch sliding packages before they crash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack and secure cargo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle random disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver before time runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep damage to a minimum for maximum payout</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No single player can do everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn More. Upgrade More.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/785335c5c072870fa7ffcbeadd1e6d00.poster.avif?t=1787275223\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/785335c5c072870fa7ffcbeadd1e6d00.webm?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877970/extras/785335c5c072870fa7ffcbeadd1e6d00.mp4?t=1787275223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete deliveries to earn <strong>Stamps</strong>, the company's official currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New worker cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New customization options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the most stylish delivery crew that's ever accidentally blown up a truck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Shift Is Different</h2><p class=